1
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,800
(Let it go.)

2
00:00:43,724 --> 00:00:45,964
=Revenge From A Wife=

3
00:00:46,091 --> 00:00:48,317
=Episode 24=

4
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:49,240
You...

5
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:51,159
If you won't drink it,

6
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:53,200
I can't promise

7
00:00:53,679 --> 00:00:55,039
Zhao will grow up safe and sound.

8
00:00:55,719 --> 00:00:57,719
After all, in this palace,

9
00:00:58,399 --> 00:00:59,759
a child dying young

10
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:02,320
is hardly unusual.

11
00:01:37,359 --> 00:01:38,159
How is that possible?

12
00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:40,280
Didn't I destroy this long ago?

13
00:01:42,439 --> 00:01:43,200
Sister.

14
00:01:45,480 --> 00:01:47,159
My skin...

15
00:01:47,799 --> 00:01:48,599
How does it feel

16
00:01:49,359 --> 00:01:50,159
wearing it?

17
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:51,239
You...

18
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:53,079
You...

19
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:54,680
How are you still alive?

20
00:01:55,719 --> 00:01:56,920
Twin blossoms.

21
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,560
One root, one fate.

22
00:02:00,079 --> 00:02:01,760
We should've helped each other grow.

23
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,560
But you just had to fight me for it all.

24
00:02:05,159 --> 00:02:06,560
You thought killing me

25
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:08,120
would give you everything.

26
00:02:09,319 --> 00:02:10,280
And now?

27
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:11,840
His Majesty has grown tired of you.

28
00:02:12,879 --> 00:02:14,800
Even Zhao has left your side.

29
00:02:15,879 --> 00:02:18,120
Everything you fought so hard to steal

30
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:20,120
has come to nothing.

31
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:20,919
You're talking nonsense.

32
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:22,560
His Majesty loves me!

33
00:02:22,919 --> 00:02:23,439
Zhao...

34
00:02:23,879 --> 00:02:26,000
Zhao was just fooled by Su Cao!

35
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:27,759
I'll win them back.

36
00:02:28,039 --> 00:02:28,840
I'll win them back!

37
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,199
If you'd really won,

38
00:02:31,199 --> 00:02:32,599
why are you so afraid?

39
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,360
Zhang Yuying.

40
00:02:36,879 --> 00:02:38,120
All your life,

41
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:39,879
everything you wanted most

42
00:02:40,599 --> 00:02:42,479
has slipped through your fingers.

43
00:02:52,759 --> 00:02:53,599
Shut up!

44
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,280
I killed you once.

45
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:56,960
I can certainly kill you again.

46
00:03:07,039 --> 00:03:08,800
Father, help me!

47
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,560
Shut up!

48
00:03:10,719 --> 00:03:11,599
Father!

49
00:03:12,159 --> 00:03:13,840
Father, save me!

50
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:20,560
Guards!

51
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:22,280
Take Consort Chen away!

52
00:03:23,039 --> 00:03:24,159
Consort Chen, stop!

53
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:33,360
Let go of me!

54
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:35,800
Die!

55
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,159
Die, all of you!

56
00:03:37,159 --> 00:03:37,719
Zhao!

57
00:03:38,319 --> 00:03:38,879
Don't be afraid.

58
00:03:38,879 --> 00:03:39,560
Zhao, don't be afraid.

59
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:40,919
Let go of me!

60
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,319
Die!

61
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:43,560
Die, all of you!

62
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:44,039
She... She...

63
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:45,759
She's gone mad!

64
00:03:45,759 --> 00:03:46,759
Her Highness has gone mad!

65
00:03:46,759 --> 00:03:48,319
Don't let her out!

66
00:03:50,159 --> 00:03:51,319
Die!

67
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:52,919
Die!

68
00:03:53,879 --> 00:03:54,479
Your Majesty.

69
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:57,280
The matter of Noble Consort Chen

70
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:59,360
has caused an uproar across the capital.

71
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:01,159
Among the people,

72
00:04:01,599 --> 00:04:03,520
a nursery rhyme is going around, too.

73
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:05,400
Recite it.

74
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:09,479
Cottage white, cottage red,

75
00:04:10,159 --> 00:04:12,680
a hundred souls lie beneath the ground.

76
00:04:13,159 --> 00:04:14,360
Uncle Shen,

77
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:15,680
the Zhang clan's man,

78
00:04:16,319 --> 00:04:19,479
a wicked consort in the gilded hall.

79
00:04:20,199 --> 00:04:22,360
Prince Ning has arrived.

80
00:04:26,839 --> 00:04:28,000
Imperial Uncle, what brings you here?

81
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:28,439
Sit.

82
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:37,199
I just passed Chengtian Gate.

83
00:04:37,759 --> 00:04:40,000
Imperial Academy students are sitting
outside the gate in protest.

84
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:41,560
Your Majesty,

85
00:04:41,879 --> 00:04:43,360
please conduct a full investigation into
Noble Consort Chen

86
00:04:43,639 --> 00:04:45,160
and the old Guizhen Cottage case.

87
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,160
(Memorial to the Throne)

88
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:53,000
They're trying to force my hand.

89
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:58,120
Your headache still hasn't eased.

90
00:04:58,399 --> 00:04:59,480
Please rest for a while.

91
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,959
From what I can tell,

92
00:05:05,959 --> 00:05:07,839
it's not the rhyme troubling you.

93
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,759
It's Zhang Heng you're troubled over.

94
00:05:15,959 --> 00:05:17,120
The frontier is still unstable.

95
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:19,199
Zhang Heng just won a major victory.

96
00:05:19,399 --> 00:05:20,399
If you move against him now,

97
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:23,279
the troop morale
at the northern frontier will crumble.

98
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,680
But if you do nothing,

99
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:27,480
the people will lose faith in you.

100
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:28,839
Your Majesty.

101
00:05:29,319 --> 00:05:30,759
I don't know much about state affairs,

102
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:32,480
but I do know one thing.

103
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:35,240
You can't silence every rumor.

104
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:37,879
Nor can you suppress every memorial
from the court's upright officials.

105
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:39,800
If you do nothing,

106
00:05:40,199 --> 00:05:41,319
the next account of this

107
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:43,079
will be in the history books.

108
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:45,439
Do you know what you're saying?

109
00:05:49,439 --> 00:05:50,720
I spoke out of turn.

110
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:14,107
♪Sunset fades beyond the lonely city♪

111
00:06:14,241 --> 00:06:17,854
♪Dusk snow paints the green hills♪

112
00:06:18,089 --> 00:06:20,688
♪A lone rider storms the old pass♪

113
00:06:20,725 --> 00:06:23,005
♪Drunk, I gaze by lamplight♪

114
00:06:23,052 --> 00:06:26,881
♪Old friends have all drifted away♪

115
00:06:27,283 --> 00:06:30,636
♪My broken sword rusts, as do I♪

116
00:06:31,563 --> 00:06:35,076
♪Jackdaws cry into the night♪

117
00:06:35,576 --> 00:06:38,143
♪Half a banner snaps in the wind♪

118
00:06:38,269 --> 00:06:40,302
♪In dreams, I return to the camps♪

119
00:06:40,369 --> 00:06:44,146
♪Moonlight chills my armor♪

120
00:06:44,496 --> 00:06:48,829
♪Life is a dream through many winters♪

121
00:06:49,052 --> 00:06:52,559
♪I gaze beyond the edge of the world♪

122
00:06:52,740 --> 00:06:55,593
♪Parting sorrow spills across the moon♪

123
00:06:55,660 --> 00:07:01,274
♪The moon and wind mean nothing now♪

124
00:07:01,314 --> 00:07:04,328
♪History turns to ash before ink dries♪

125
00:07:04,369 --> 00:07:10,377
♪Who plays the zither
and sighs at the pavilion?♪

126
00:07:11,044 --> 00:07:17,999
♪The past has faded away♪

127
00:07:17,999 --> 00:07:22,031
♪The past has faded away♪
